Original commit body from d04bed16a5bd6d320eb35eb1368c163e49ab2419:

Proto, Thrift, Cap'n Proto, QML, Nix, Zig and GDScript, and a few member
kinds of Scala, Kotlin, C#, Swift, PHP and Dart, computed no stable_id and
rode the ADR-0035 backstop floor key (kind, language, path, name). The key
has no scope, so the same name in two scopes of one file (rpc Get in two
services, message Inner nested in two messages, run in two QML elements or
two Nix attribute sets, object Inner in two Scala classes) shared it and
both members were null.

- proto: messages and rpc methods mint declared_arity_stable_id over the
  package plus EVERY enclosing message/service; qualified_name now carries
  the full chain (demo.A.B.Inner, was demo.B.Inner).
- thrift: functions, typedefs, consts over namespace.service.name.
- capnp: methods and consts over every enclosing struct/interface.
- gdscript: functions via compute_stable_id, signals arity-less, over the
  inner-class/function chain.
- zig: functions/methods via compute_stable_id; fields, unions, error sets,
  tests arity-less; the hash takes the full container/function chain (the
  emitted name keeps the immediate container).
- qml: every symbol over the chain of enclosing object declarations,
  tracked by brace depth (Type, prop:Type, Type#id).
- nix: every symbol over the attribute-path chain (let-bound names marked
  let:, file-level function contents under the file stem).
- scala object/given, kotlin object, csharp property, swift computed
  property and subscript (parameter types), php field: make_typed_stable_id
  over the type and the full scope chain, as their producers' fields do.
- dart constructors, getters, setters, mixins, extensions: the typed
  formula with an empty signature over the owner-qualified name.

Floor/null -> producer only: every previously producer-computed id is
byte-identical on the gate fixtures and a corpus sample (13 languages,
up to 40 files each plus 47 envoy api protos; no node renamed, added or
removed). Baseline: 18 langs 28 floor / 16 null, 23 deletion failures ->
5 langs 10 floor / 2 null, 16.

Also: swift _subscript_name is annotated str (it never returns None),
which shrinks the mypy strict surface 498 -> 497; signature_axis /
module_key_axis / symbol_kinds line citations re-pointed.

